%% WeaveNYC — Report and Moderation Flow
%% Source: 07_P2P_Node_Design.md §4 Flow B

sequenceDiagram
    participant E1 as Reporter
    participant A as Anchor Node<br/>(Community Admin)
    participant E2 as Reported User

    E1->>A: 1. Create report<br/>(post_id + reason + evidence_hash)
    A->>A: 2. Enter review queue<br/>Prioritized (P0/P1/P2)

    Note over A: P0 (Child safety/Violence/Scam): within 4h<br/>P1 (Harassment/Discrimination): within 24h<br/>P2 (Spam): within 72h

    alt Decision: Remove / Ban
        A->>A: 3a. moderation.decision (remove/ban)
        A-->>E2: 3b. Notify: Content removed / Account frozen
        A-->>E1: 3c. Notify: Report resolved
    else Decision: Warning
        A-->>E2: 3a. Notify: Warning + reason
        A-->>E1: 3b. Notify: Report resolved
    else Decision: Dismiss
        A-->>E1: 3a. Notify: Report dismissed
    end

    A->>A: 4. Write to audit log
